{"id":"8e14b2a12eb3841f","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-logos.md","title":"logos","display":"df-logos — logos","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-logos","display":"df-logos — logos","depends_on":["[[16-df-coherent-category]]","[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]","[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]"],"source":"§4.5, pp. 265–270 (PDF 285–290)","revision_date":"2026-10-07","aliases":["16-df-logos"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-logos"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logos — logos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9a42bbee3cfe3d34\" href=\"?note=9a42bbee3cfe3d34\" title=\"16-df-coherent-category\">16-df-coherent-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§4.5, pp. 265–270 (PDF 285–290)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-logos</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为有限极限范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{\\rm Sub}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p_{\\rm Sub}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>FOFib</code> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFib}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logos}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logos}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logos}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Logos}(\\mathcal B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FOFib}(p_{\\rm Sub}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logos}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Logos}(\\mathcal B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FOFib}(p_{\\rm Sub}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>等价地：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是 coherent 范畴，每个子对象偏序有相对伪补，拉回保持蕴涵，而且具有满足简单 BC 的全称量词。</li>\n<li>“logos” 是本书的术语；不要与 pretopos 或 topos 不加说明地混同。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§4.5, pp. 265–270 (PDF 285–290)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-coherent-category","status":"resolved","id":"9a42bbee3cfe3d34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-coherent-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为有限极限范畴，$p_{\\rm Sub}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal B$ 见 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"`FOFib` 采用 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-first-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOFib}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"p_{\\rm Sub}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logos}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{Logos}(\\mathcal B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FOFib}(p_{\\rm Sub}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false}],"bytes":1238,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-logos|df-logos — logos]]"}],"outgoing":["9a42bbee3cfe3d34","66d3058a6ae62dc5","6c23c06c4d297e8d"]}